    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>VO2max 18 cycles (48min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min ramp from 50% to 75% FTP | Over-Under: 18 cycles (alternating above/below threshold) | Cooldown: 5min from 60% to 45% FTP</description>
